      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your grief makes logical sense because the foundation you built has truly crumbled, but trying to force a start when you feel erased is a trap that only adds more pain. The reason to keep breathing isn't about successful games or building wealth anymore, but simply acknowledging that even in this despair, a small part of you still exists and deserves to be witnessed. Please call a crisis line or go to an emergency room right now, because you cannot reason your way out of a feeling that needs professional help to untangle.",
